    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Crab Race",
      "",
      "One day, Little Ming asked, “Dad, take a guess! One red crab and one black crab run in a race, who will win?”",
      "",
      "Dad said. “It … certainly is the black crab. That red crab is cooked!”",
      "",
      "Little Ming, seeing that his dad guessed so quickly, felt very disappointed.",
      "He blurted out, “Incorrect! These two crabs are both cooked!”",
      "",
      "Dad asked with a laugh, “Then why is one red, and one black?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming blinked and said, “The red crab is cooked. That black crab is burnt!”"
    ]
